{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09035","headline":"沣上寄幼遐 · 韦应物","name":"沣上寄幼遐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞到城阙，惆怅返柴荆。\n端居无所爲，念子远徂征。\n夏昼人已息，我怀独未宁。\n忽从东斋起，兀兀寻涧行。\n罥罣丛榛密，披玩孤花明。\n旷然西南望，一极山水情。\n周览同游处，逾恨阻音形。\n壮图非旦夕，君子勤令名。\n勿复久留燕，蹉跎在北京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}